<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><%- include('head', { title: qualifiers.title, description: 'November 7–8, 2026 at Stauffer Library, Room 014. Five Swiss rounds, 30+30, $20 entry. Queen’s students and community members welcome.' }) %></head>
<body class="site-page">
<%- include('header') %>
<main id="main-content">
  <section class="qualifier-hero">
    <div class="site-shell qualifier-hero-grid"><div class="qualifier-hero-copy"><a class="text-link" href="/eventsPage">← All events</a><p class="eyebrow">Queen’s Chess Club · Registration open</p><h1>CUCC<br><em>Qualifiers.</em></h1><p class="qualifier-hero-intro">Your next move could take you to Waterloo.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button button-gold" href="<%= qualifiers.registration %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Register for <%= qualifiers.fee %> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span>Students & community members welcome</span></div></div><figure class="qualifier-signup"><a href="<%= qualifiers.registration %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Open the CUCC Qualifiers registration form"><img src="/images/cucc-qualifiers-2026-qr.svg" width="240" height="240" alt="QR code for the CUCC Qualifiers registration form"></a><figcaption>Scan to sign up<span>CUCC Qualifiers · November 7–8</span></figcaption></figure></div>
  </section>
  <section class="site-shell section-space" aria-labelledby="details-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">November 7–8, 2026</p><h2 id="details-title">Two days. Five rounds. Your move.</h2></div></div>
    <dl class="tournament-facts">
      <div><dt>Date</dt><dd><%= qualifiers.date %></dd></div>
      <div><dt>First round</dt><dd><%= qualifiers.start %></dd></div>
      <div><dt>Location</dt><dd><%= qualifiers.location %></dd></div>
      <div><dt>Format</dt><dd><%= qualifiers.format %></dd></div>
      <div><dt>Time control</dt><dd><%= qualifiers.timeControl %><small>30 minutes + 30 seconds per move</small></dd></div>
      <div><dt>Registration fee</dt><dd><%= qualifiers.fee %></dd></div>
    </dl>
    <div class="qualifier-info">
      <div><h2>Play for Queen’s.</h2><p>Represent Queen’s at the Canadian University Chess Championships (CUCC). The final standings will play a major role in selecting Queen’s teams for the 2027 Canadian Inter-University Chess Championships at the University of Waterloo, January 15–17, 2027.</p><p>Team spots are reserved for Queen’s students who are available to travel for those dates. Community members and players who aren’t trying out for a team are welcome to compete in the qualifiers.</p></div>
      <aside class="learning-aside"><p class="eyebrow">Save your seat</p><h2>Ready to play?</h2><p>Register in advance through the form, or sign up in person on the day of the tournament.</p><p>Pay <%= qualifiers.fee %> in cash on-site or by e-transfer to <a href="mailto:<%= club.email %>"><%= club.email %></a>. If someone else pays for you, include the payer’s name in the registration form.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="<%= qualifiers.registration %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open registration form <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></aside>
    </div>
    <p class="qualifier-contact">Questions? Contact <a href="<%= club.instagram %>">@queensuchess</a> on Instagram or email <a href="mailto:<%= club.email %>"><%= club.email %></a>.</p>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include('footer') %>
</body>
</html>
